lin, a lap down, loses third gear but holds second.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":55,"text":"So Czaykowski won from Etancelin and de Maleplane, while Scaron did an impressive job with the little Amilcar to finish fourth overall and first in the voiturette class.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":55,"text":"Ferrand was fifth, Galba an excellent 6th and second in the voiturette class followed by Grimaldi and Plat\u00e9, who was third in the voiturette class.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"}]}